### booking-service on your PC (Lab 4) - start it first:  cd services/booking-service && npm run dev
### Open in VS Code with the REST Client extension and click "Send Request".
### For requests that need a token: sign in with identity/requests.http first and paste the accessToken.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3003
@token = PASTE-ACCESS-TOKEN-HERE

### Health -> 200, runtime pc
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

@classId = PASTE-A-classId-FROM-GET-/api/classes

### Book a class as a member -> 201 (409 CLASS_FULL / ALREADY_BOOKED, 403 MEMBER_SUSPENDED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "classId": "{{classId}}" }

### My bookings -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Without a token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/mine

### Join the waitlist (only when the class is full) -> 201 or 409 SEATS_AVAILABLE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/waitlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "classId": "{{classId}}" }

### Internal endpoint without the service key -> 403 INTERNAL_ONLY
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/booking-counts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "classIds": [] }
